# Skill: Compile Administration Documents
When modifying or compiling the syllabus or course contract:

- Execute `silabus\compile_silabus.bat` for any syllabus documentation compilations.
- Execute `kontrak_kuliah\compile_kontrak.bat` for contract compilations.

Both scripts naturally move the resulting compiled PDFs to the `output/` folder to maintain directory hygiene.
